\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\cf1\insrsid16668280 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 5. Ordinal-aware evaluation and modeling}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\cf1\insrsid16668280 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 
 -- Quadratic Weighted Kappa alongside F1-macro, and a genuine, adopted change of modeling approach (regression-then-threshold) for the hardest target, PHQ9 Result.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\cf1\insrsid16668280 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 6. An expli\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 cit, honestly-reported interpretability-over-accuracy trade-off}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f37\cf1\insrsid16668280 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37  -- documenting that a Stacking Ensemble is technically more accurate for PPD_binary, while explaining precisely why a single Random Forest was kept as the project's explainable backbone.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\cf1\insrsid16668280 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 7. Tr\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 ansparent negative results}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\cf1\insrsid16668280 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 
 -- LR-learned weights, SMOTE, MICE imputation, Age features, and the final closing-loop feature test were all tested and, where they did not help, honestly reported as rejected rather than omitted -- itself evidence of methodolog
